 "平年並": "عَادِيّ (according to norms or rules) / عَادِيّ (usual, ordinary) / طَبِيعِيّ (usual, ordinary)  [normal]\nمثال: 農作物は平年並みだ。\n→ The crops are up to the average.",
 "平年並み": "عَادِيّ (according to norms or rules) / عَادِيّ (usual, ordinary) / طَبِيعِيّ (usual, ordinary)  [normal]\nمثال: 農作物は平年並みだ。\n→ The crops are up to the average.",
