 "平手": "رَاحَة, كَفّ (The inner and somewhat concave part of the human hand or other primate hand that)  [palm]\nمثال: 昔は、悪いことをすると、学校の先生から平手をくらったり拳固をもらうことが当たり前だった。\n→ In the past it was perfectly normal to get the back of a teacher's hand or fist as punishment. / [playing on equal terms ; lack of handicap]",
