 "平手打ち": "صَفْعَة, لَطْمَة (A blow, especially one given with the open hand, or with something broad and fla) / صَفَعَ (to give a slap) / لَطَمَ (to give a slap)  [slap]\nمثال: その子はお行儀悪くして母親に平手打ちされた。\n→ That kid got a slap from his mother for being rude.",
 "平打": "[blow with the flat of a sword] / صَفْعَة, لَطْمَة (A blow, especially one given with the open hand, or with something broad and fla) / صَفَعَ (to give a slap) / لَطَمَ (to give a slap)  [slap] / [metal flattened by striking] / شَرِيط (Any video or audio recording, regardless of the method used to produce it.)  [tape]",
 "平打ち": "[blow with the flat of a sword] / صَفْعَة, لَطْمَة (A blow, especially one given with the open hand, or with something broad and fla) / صَفَعَ (to give a slap) / لَطَمَ (to give a slap)  [slap] / [metal flattened by striking] / شَرِيط (Any video or audio recording, regardless of the method used to produce it.)  [tape]",
 "平方": "مُرَبَّع (A polygon with four straight sides of equal length and four right angles; an equ) / مُرَبَّع (Shaped like a square (the polygon).) / مُرَبَّع (Used in the names of units of area formed by multiplying a unit of length by its)  [square (e.g. metre)]\nمثال: 縦横８フィートの部屋の面積は６４平方フィートである。\n→ The area of an 8-foot square room is 64 square feet.",
 "平方メートル": "مِتْرٌ مُرَبَّعٌ (A standard unit of area, regardless of its shape, equal to the area of a square )  [square metre]\nمثال: この床の面積は６００平方メートルある。\n→ The area of this floor is 600 square meters.",
 "平方形": "مُرَبَّع (A polygon with four straight sides of equal length and four right angles; an equ) / مُرَبَّع (Shaped like a square (the polygon).) / مُرَبَّع (Used in the names of units of area formed by multiplying a unit of length by its)  [square]",
