 "平易": "سَهْل (Requiring little skill or effort.)  [easy]\nمثال: これは平易な英語でかかれた書物です。\n→ This is a story written in easy English.",
 "平時": "وَقْت السَّلَامِ, وَقْت السِّلْمِ (The period of time when a nation or people is at peace, not fighting a war.)  [peacetime] / [ordinary times ; normal times]",
 "平板": "بَلَاط (A paving stone; a flagstone.)  [slab] / مُمِلّ (Tedious, repetitious, or lacking in variety.)  [monotonous] / [even pitch ; accentless pitch]",
 "平民主義": "دِيمُقْرَاطِيَّة (rule by the people) / دِيمُقْرَاطِيَّة (government under the rule of its people)  [democracy]",
 "平民的": "شَائِع (Found in large numbers or in a large quantity; usual.) / شَائِع (Simple, ordinary or vulgar.)  [common]",
 "平気": "بَارِد (Of a mildly low temperature.) / يُبَرِّد (To lose heat, to get colder.)  [cool]\nمثال: 彼は平気でうそをつく。\n→ He has no scruples about lying. / جَيِّد (Good; in acceptable, if not excellent condition.) / حَسَنًا (Fairly well.) / حَسَنًا (Used to affirm, indicate agreement, or consent.)  [all right]",
