 "弁疏": "عَذَرَ (To forgive; to pardon; to overlook.) / اِعْتَذَرَ (To allow to leave, or release from any obligation.) / عُذْر (An explanation designed to avoid or alleviate guilt or negative judgment; a plea)  [excuse]",
