 "弊": "ضَرَرٌ (Physical injury; hurt; damage.) / ضَرَّ أَضَرَّ (To damage, hurt, or injure something, usually an inanimate object.)  [harm] / ـِي, ـي (First-person singular possessive determiner. See Appendix:Possessive#English.)  [my]",
 "弊害": "تَعَسُّف, طُغْيَان (Improper treatment or usage; application to a wrong or bad purpose; an unjust, c) / مَسَبَّة, شَتِيمَة (Coarse, insulting speech; abusive language; language that unjustly or angrily vi) / إِيذَاء جَسَدِيّ (Physical maltreatment; injury; cruel treatment.) / اِنْتِهَاك جَسَدِيّ (Violation; defilement; rape; forcing of undesired sexual activity by one person ) / أَسَاءَ اِسْتِعْمَالَ (To put to a wrong use; to misapply; to use improperly; to use for a wrong purpos) / آذَى (To injure; to maltreat; to hurt; to treat with cruelty, especially repeatedly.) / أَهَانَ, سَبَّ (To attack with coarse language; to insult; to revile; malign; to speak in an off) / اِغْتَصَبَ, اِنْتَهَكَ (To violate; defile; to rape; (reflexive) to masturbate.) / خَدَعَ, غَشَّ (To deceive; to trick; to impose on; misuse the confidence of.)  [abuse]\nمثال: 喫煙は体に弊害である。\n→ Smoking has an ill effect upon health.",
