 "引きうける": "قَامَ (To take upon oneself; to start, to embark on.)  [to undertake]\nمثال: その仕事を引き受けようかなと思っている。\n→ I'm wondering whether to take on that job. / وَرَثَ (to receive property or a title by legal succession etc.)  [to inherit] / ضَمَان, ضَمَانَة (Anything that assures a certain outcome.) / ضَمِنَ (To give an assurance that something will be done right.)  [to guarantee] / عَقْد, مُعَاهَدَة (An agreement which the law will enforce in some way. A legally binding contract ) / أَغْدَمَ, اِدَّغَمَ (To shorten by omitting a letter or letters or by reducing two or more vowels or )  [to contract (a disease)]",
