 "引きしぼる": "[to draw (a bow) to the limit]\nمثال: 彼は声を引き絞って歌った。\n→ He sang with his voice strained. / [to pull tight ; to squeeze tight] / سُلَالَة (Race; lineage, pedigree.)  [to strain (voice)]",
 "引きしめる": "شَدَّ, ضَيَّقَ (To make tighter.)  [to tighten]\nمثال: ウィッチヘーゼルは、乾燥させずに毛穴を引き締めます。\n→ Witch hazel tightens pores without drying skin.",
 "引きずる": "جَرَّ (To pull along a surface or through a medium, sometimes with difficulty.)  [to drag]\nمثال: 私は重い荷物を空港まで引きずって行った。\n→ I dragged the heavy baggage to the airport. / جَرَّ (To pull along a surface or through a medium, sometimes with difficulty.)  [to drag (along)]\nمثال: 彼は彼女の腕を取り、引きずっていった。\n→ He seized her hand and dragged her away. / أَطَالَ (To extend in space or length.) / أَطَالَ (To lengthen in time; to extend the duration of.)  [to prolong] / نَفُوذ, تَأْثِير (The power to affect, control or manipulate something or someone; the ability to ) / تَأْثِير (An action exerted by a person or thing with such power on another to cause chang) / أَثَّرَ (To have an effect on by using gentle or subtle action; to exert an influence upo)  [to influence]\nusu. in the passive",
 "引きつける": "اِجْتَذَبَ, جَذَبَ (To pull toward without touching.)  [to attract (to oneself, e.g. with bait or light)]\nمثال: この磁鉄鉱は地球の磁場に引きつけられる。\n→ The magnetite is attracted to the earth's magnetic field. / اِجْتَذَبَ, جَذَبَ (To pull toward without touching.)  [to attract]\nمثال: そのサッカーの試合は大観衆を引き付けた。\n→ The soccer game attracted a large crowd. / [to have a convulsion ; to convulse]",
 "引きつづく": "تَابَعَ, اِسْتَمَرَّ (To proceed with (doing an activity); to prolong (an activity).) / تَابَعَ, اِسْتَمَرَّ (To resume.)  [to continue (for a long time)]\nمثال: 式に引き続いてパーティーがあった。\n→ The ceremony was followed by the reception.",
 "引きつり": "نَدْبَة, نَدْب (A permanent mark on the skin, sometimes caused by the healing of a wound.)  [scar] / تَشَنُّج (A sudden, involuntary contraction of a muscle, a group of muscles, or a hollow o)  [spasm]",
 "引きつる": "زِيَار (A stick with a hole in one end through which passes a loop, which can be drawn t)  [to twitch]\nمثال: 顔がひきつります。\n→ My face twitches. / جَمَدَ (To become stiff.)  [to stiffen (of a face, expression)]\nمثال: ジョンの顔は引きつっていた。\n→ John's face was drawn. / قَلَّصَ (To cause to become smaller.) / تَقَلَّصَ, أَحْجَمَ (To become smaller; to contract.)  [to shrink (of skin, due to a scar)]",
