 "引き上げ": "[pulling up ; drawing up] / رَفَعَ (to cause to rise)  [raising]\nمثال: 関税引き上げの提案国はお互いに反目しています。\n→ Proponents of increased import duties are at odds with each other. / إخْلَاء, تَخْلِيَة (The act of evacuating; leaving a place in an orderly fashion, especially for saf) / إخْلَاء (Withdrawal of troops or civils from a town, country, fortress, etc.) / تَفْرِيغ, تَخْلِيَة (The act of emptying, clearing of the contents, or discharging, including creatin)  [evacuation]",
