 "引き比べる": "قَارَنَ (To assess the similarities and differences between two or more things [“to compa) / شَبَّهَ (To declare two things to be similar in some respect [“to compare X to Y”].)  [to compare]",
 "引き波": "[backwash ; rip current] / [stern wave] / عائِق (A disadvantage; something that detracts or takes away.)  [drawback (of a tsunami, i.e. when a wave trough reaches land before a crest)]",
 "引き渡し": "تَوْصِيل, تَسْلِيم (The act of conveying something.) / مَخَاض, وَضْع (The act or process of a mother giving birth.) / إِلْقَاء (The manner of speaking or singing.)  [delivery]",
 "引き渡す": "نَقَلَ (To bring or transport something to its destination.)  [to deliver]\nمثال: その男は警察へ引き渡された。\n→ The man was handed over to the police.",
 "引き物": "هَدِيَّة, هدية (Something given to another voluntarily, without charge.) / قَرِيحَة (A talent or natural ability.) / أَهْدَى (To give as a gift or donation.)  [gift] / سِتَارَة (A piece of cloth covering a window, bed, etc. to offer privacy and keep out ligh)  [curtain] / مِقْبَض (The part of an object which is (designed to be) held in the hand when used or mo)  [handle (on a fusuma or shoji door)]",
 "引き留める": "اِعْتَقَلَ (To put someone under custody.)  [to detain]\nمثال: 引き止めても無駄だ。\n→ It's no use holding me back.",
