 "引き継ぎ": "وَرَثَ (to receive property or a title by legal succession etc.)  [inheriting]\nمثال: 新大臣は月曜日に職務の引継をした。\n→ The new minister took over the job on Monday.",
 "引き継ぐ": "وَرَثَ (to receive property or a title by legal succession etc.)  [to inherit]\nمثال: 私の息子が仕事を引き継ぐだろう。\n→ My son will take over the job. / سَلَّمَ (To relinquish control or possession of something to someone.)  [to hand over]",
 "引き続き": "باستمرار (Without pause.)  [continuously]\nمثال: 引き続き努力いたします。\n→ I will continue with my efforts. / قَادِم (Nearest in place or position, having nothing similar intervening; adjoining.) / تَالٍ (Nearest in order, succession, or rank; immediately following (or sometimes prece) / بِجَانِب (On the side of; nearest or adjacent to; next to.)  [next]",
