 "引き込み線": "جَانِب (A bounding straight edge of a two-dimensional shape.) / جَانِب (One half (left or right, top or bottom, front or back, etc.) of something or som) / صَفْحَة (One surface of a sheet of paper (used instead of \"page\", which can mean one or b)  [(railway) siding]",
 "引き返す": "عَادَ, رَجَعَ (To return to a place.)  [to come back]\nمثال: 今は引き返すには遅すぎる。\n→ It's too late to turn back now.",
