 "当": "هَٰذَا, هَٰذِهِ (The known (thing) (used in indicating something or someone about to be mentioned) / هَٰذَا, هَٰذِهِ (Designates the current or next instance.) / هٰذَا, هٰذِهِ (The thing, item, etc. being indicated.)  [this]\nمثال: 当ホテルでの御宿泊をごゆっくり御楽しみください。\n→ Please enjoy your stay at this hotel. / يَمِين, يمين (Clockwise, particularly when describing a change in direction or orientation.) / صَحِيح, صَوَاب (Complying with justice, correctness, or reason; correct, just, true. See also th) / قَائِم (Of an angle, measuring 90 degrees, or one quarter of a complete rotation; the an) / عَلَى اَلْيَمِين (On the right side.) / إِلَى اَلْيَمِين (Towards the right side.) / صحيح, تمام (Yes, that is correct; I agree.) / حَقّ, حُقُوق (A legal, just or moral entitlement.) / يَمِين (A wave breaking from right to left (viewed from the shore).) / صَحَّحَ (To correct.)  [right] / [checking account]",
