 "心配": "قَلِقَ (To be troubled; to give way to mental anxiety or doubt.) / قَلَق (A strong feeling of anxiety.)  [worry]\nمثال: その男の子は心配して病気になった。\n→ The boy got sick from anxiety. / اِهْتِمَام (Close attention; concern; responsibility.) / عِنَايَة, رِعَايَة (The treatment of those in need (especially as a profession).) / اِهْتَمَّ بِـ (To be concerned (about), to have an interest (in); to feel concern (about).) / اِهْتَمَّ بِـ ((with for) To look after or look out for.)  [care]\nمثال: 心配してくれる人がいて幸せだ。\n→ I'm so lucky to have someone who cares.",
