 "心霊": "رُوح (The soul of a person or other creature.) / رُوَح (A supernatural being, often but not exclusively without physical form; ghost, fa) / كُحُول (A volatile liquid, such as alcohol. The plural form spirits is a generic term fo)  [spirit (e.g. human spirit)] / رُوح (The soul of a person or other creature.) / رُوَح (A supernatural being, often but not exclusively without physical form; ghost, fa) / كُحُول (A volatile liquid, such as alcohol. The plural form spirits is a generic term fo)  [spirit]",
 "心静か": "هَادِئ (Peaceful, quiet, especially free from anger and anxiety.) / طَمْأَنَ (To make calm.)  [calm]\nمثال: 心静かに花鳥風月を愛でる気持ちの余裕も最近になってでてきたよ。\n→ Lately I've had the time to quietly enjoy the wonders of nature.",
