 "必ず": "دَائِمًا, أَبَدًا (At all times; throughout all time; since the beginning.)  [always]\nمثال: あの歌は必ずヒットするよ。\n→ That song's bound to be a hit.",
 "必ずしも": "دَائِمًا, أَبَدًا (At all times; throughout all time; since the beginning.)  [(not) always]\nwith neg. sentence\nمثال: 金持ちが必ずしも幸福とは限らない。\n→ The rich are not always happy.",
 "必ずや": "بِالتَّأْكِيد (In a way which is certain; with certainty.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (Without doubt, surely.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (An emphatic affirmative answer; of course.)  [certainly]\nمثال: その計画は必ずや実行しなければならない。\n→ The plan should be carried through.",
