 "必死": "يَائِس, قَانِط (Being filled with, or in a state of, despair; hopeless.) / مَيْئُوس مِنْهُ (Beyond hope, leaving little reason for hope; causing despair; extremely perilous)  [desperate]\nمثال: その奴隷は必死に逃げた。\n→ The slave ran for his life. / [inevitable death] / [brinkmate (inevitable checkmate)]",
