 "応え": "رَدّ (A response or reply; something said or done in reaction to a statement or questi) / حَلّ, حَلّ (A solution to a problem.) / أَجَابَ, رَدَّ (To make a reply or response to.) / رَدّ (To respond to a call by someone at a door or telephone, or other similar piece o)  [answer]\nمثال: キャロルは拒絶した。言い換えると、彼女の答えは「ノー」だった。\n→ Carol refused; in other words her answer was \"no.\" / رَدّ (A response or reply; something said or done in reaction to a statement or questi) / حَلّ, حَلّ (A solution to a problem.) / أَجَابَ, رَدَّ (To make a reply or response to.) / رَدّ (To respond to a call by someone at a door or telephone, or other similar piece o)  [answer]\nمثال: 彼女の答えは間違っていた。\n→ Her answer was incorrect.",
