 "応援": "مُسَاعَدَة (Help; assistance; succor, relief.)  [aid]\nمثال: 何事が起ころうとも、君を応援するよ。\n→ I will stand by you whatever happens. / جَذْر, جدر (The part of a plant, generally underground, that anchors and supports the plant ) / جَذْر (The part of a tooth extending into the bone holding the tooth in place.) / أَصْل (The primary source; origin.) / جَذْر (Of a number or expression, a number which, when raised to a specified power, yie) / جَذْر (The primary lexical unit of a word, which carries the most significant aspects o) / أَصْل (A word from which another word or words are derived.)  [rooting (for)]\nمثال: 彼女は自分のひいきの馬を応援した。\n→ She cheered for her favorite horse.",
