 "快癒": "شِفَاء, تَعَافِي (A return to normal health.)  [recovery]\nمثال: 母は神経痛が快癒した。\n→ My mother made a complete recovery from neuralgia.",
 "快美": "حُلْو (Having a pleasant smell; fragrant.) / حَلْوَى (A confection made from sugar, or high in sugar content; a candy.)  [sweet]",
 "快調": "حَسَن, جَيِّد (Of a person or an animal:) / حَسَن, جَيِّد (Of a capability:) / صِحِّيّ (Of a property or quality:) / حَسَنًا (That is good; an elliptical exclamation of satisfaction or commendation.) / خَيْر (The forces or behaviours that are the enemy of evil. Usually consists of helping) / سِلْعَة (An item of merchandise.)  [good (condition)]\nمثال: この車は以前ほど快調に走らない。\n→ This car is running less smoothly than it used to.",
 "快辯": "بَلَاغَة, فَصَاحَة (The quality of artistry and persuasiveness in speech or writing.)  [eloquence]",
 "快適": "سَارّ, لَطِيف (Giving pleasure; pleasing in manner.)  [pleasant]\nمثال: これはたいそう快適な暖炉ですね。\n→ This is a very nice fireplace.",
 "快適さ": "رَاحَة (Contentment, ease.) / جابر (A consolation; something relieving suffering or worry.) / وَاسَى, عَزَّى (To relieve the distress or suffering of; to provide comfort to.)  [comfort]",
 "快音": "صَدْع (A thin and usually jagged space opened in a previously solid material.)  [crack (of a baseball bat)]",
 "忰せる": "جُلْبَة (An incrustation over a sore, wound, vesicle, or pustule, formed during healing.)  [to scab] / [to be poisoned (with lacquer)] / [to waste away]",
 "念": "حَاسَّة (Any of the manners by which living beings perceive the physical world: for human) / إِحْسَاس, شُعُور (Perception through the intellect; apprehension; awareness.) / مَعْنَى, دَلَالَة (The meaning, reason, or value of something.) / مَوْهِبَة, قُدْرَة طَبِيعِيَّة (A natural appreciation or ability.) / حَسَّ (To use biological senses: to either see, hear, smell, taste, or feel.)  [sense]\nesp. 〜の念\nمثال: その光景を見て私は驚異の念にうたれた。\n→ The sight struck me with wonder. / رَغِبَ (To want; to wish for earnestly.) / رَغْبَة (Someone or something wished for.)  [desire] / اِهْتِمَام, اِنْتِبَاه (Mental focus.)  [attention]\nesp. 念に〜、念の／が〜",
 "念い": "فِكْر, فِكْرَة (A representation created in the mind without the use of one's faculties of visio) / فِكْر, تَفْكِير (The operation by which mental activity arise or are manipulated; the process of )  [thought] / خَيَّال, تَخَيُّل (The image-making power of the mind; the act of mentally creating or reproducing ) / صُورَة ذِهْنِيَّة (A mental image formed by the action of the imagination as a faculty; something i)  [imagination] / رَغِبَ (To want; to wish for earnestly.) / رَغْبَة (Someone or something wished for.)  [desire] / حَبِيب, حَبِيبَة (A person who is the object of romantic feelings; a darling, a sweetheart, a belo) / أَحَبَّ, حب (To have a strong affection for (someone or something).) / أَحَبَّ (To be strongly inclined towards something; an emphatic form of like.)  [love]\ne.g. Ａ思いのＢ for 'B who loves A'",
 "念じる": "أُمْنِيَّة (desire) / رَغْبَة (desire) / مُنْيَة (desire) / تَمَنَّى (To hope (for a particular outcome), even if that outcome is unlikely to occur or)  [to wish (for)] / أُهْزُوجَة, أَهَازِيج (Type of singing done generally without instruments and harmony.)  [to chant (a silent prayer)]",
 "念ずる": "أُمْنِيَّة (desire) / رَغْبَة (desire) / مُنْيَة (desire) / تَمَنَّى (To hope (for a particular outcome), even if that outcome is unlikely to occur or)  [to wish (for)] / أُهْزُوجَة, أَهَازِيج (Type of singing done generally without instruments and harmony.)  [to chant (a silent prayer)]",
 "念のため": "[just to make sure ; just to be sure]\nمثال: 念のためにもう一度申しますが、締め切りは３月３１日です。\n→ Let me remind you again that March 31st is the due date. / تَحَسُبًا (To provide for a possible event as a precaution.)  [just in case]\nمثال: 念のためＸ線写真をとりましょう。\n→ Let's take an X-ray just in case.",
 "念の為": "[just to make sure ; just to be sure]\nمثال: 念のためにもう一度申しますが、締め切りは３月３１日です。\n→ Let me remind you again that March 31st is the due date. / تَحَسُبًا (To provide for a possible event as a precaution.)  [just in case]\nمثال: 念のためＸ線写真をとりましょう。\n→ Let's take an X-ray just in case.",
 "念を入れる": "أَعَارَ اِنْتِبَاه (To attend; to be attentive; to focus one's attention.)  [to pay attention]",
 "念を押す": "ذَكَّرَ (To cause one to experience a memory (of someone or something); to bring to the n)  [to remind (someone of something)]\nمثال: 彼は妻に自分を午前７時に起こしてくれるように念を押した。\n→ He reminded his wife to wake him up at 7:00 a.m.",
 "念入り": "حَذِر (Taking care; attentive to potential danger, error or harm; cautious.) / دَقِيق (Conscientious and painstaking; meticulous.)  [careful]\nمثال: ジョンは、念入りにその事故を調査した。\n→ John investigated the accident thoroughly.",
 "念入れ": "اِهْتِمَام (Close attention; concern; responsibility.) / عِنَايَة, رِعَايَة (The treatment of those in need (especially as a profession).) / اِهْتَمَّ بِـ (To be concerned (about), to have an interest (in); to feel concern (about).) / اِهْتَمَّ بِـ ((with for) To look after or look out for.)  [care]",
 "念力": "إِيمَان, مُعْتَقَد (A conviction about abstractions, ideas, or beliefs, without empirical evidence, ) / إِيمَان, دِين (A religious or spiritual belief system.)  [faith] / [telekinesis ; psychokinesis]",
 "念書": "مُذَكِرَة (A short note serving as a reminder.)  [memorandum]",
 "念波": "تَخَاطُر (The capability to communicate directly by psychic means; the sympathetic affecti)  [telepathy]",
 "念無し": "مُفَاجِئ (Not expected, anticipated or foreseen.)  [unexpected] / [regrettable] / سَهْل (Requiring little skill or effort.)  [easy] / [without regrets]",
 "念珠": "مِسْبَحَة, سُبْحَة (Prayer beads, a string of beads used to keep track of repetitions in prayer, par) / مِسْبَحَة, سُبْحَة (A Roman Catholic devotion involving the repetition of a series of Marian prayers)  [rosary]",
 "念頭": "عَقْل (A healthy mental state.)  [(on one's) mind]\nمثال: 彼女はあまり夢中になっていて周囲のことなど念頭になかった。\n→ She was so preoccupied that she was oblivious of her surroundings.",
 "念頭におく": "ذَكَرَ, حَفِظَ (To hold (something) in the memory; to remember; also, to be mindful of or pay at)  [to bear in mind]",
 "念頭に入れる": "ذَكَرَ, حَفِظَ (To hold (something) in the memory; to remember; also, to be mindful of or pay at)  [to bear in mind]\nnon-standard variant of 念頭に置く",
 "念頭に置く": "ذَكَرَ, حَفِظَ (To hold (something) in the memory; to remember; also, to be mindful of or pay at)  [to bear in mind]",
