 "思い事": "رَغِبَ (To want; to wish for earnestly.) / رَغْبَة (Someone or something wished for.)  [desire]",
 "思い人": "عَاشِق, عَاشِقَة (One who loves and cares for another person in a romantic way; a sweetheart, love) / عَاشِق, عَاشِقَة (A sexual partner, especially one with whom someone is having an affair.) / مُغْرَم (A person who loves something.)  [lover]",
 "思い付き": "فِكْرَة, فِكْر (An image of an object that is formed in the mind or recalled by the memory.) / فِكْرَة, فِكْر (More generally, any result of mental activity; a thought, a notion; a way of thi)  [idea]\nمثال: それについて一つ思いつきを言ってもいいですか。\n→ May I make a suggestion about it?",
