 "恐るべき": "فَظِيع (Dreadful; causing terror, alarm and fear; awesome) / مُرْعِب (Formidable, powerful.) / مُرْعِب (Intense; extreme in degree or extent.) / فَظِيع, أَرْبَد (Very unpleasant; disagreeable.) / فَظِيع, أَرْبَد (Very bad; lousy.)  [terrible]\nمثال: エイズウイルスの拡散は恐るべき速さで進んでいる。\n→ The speed of the spread of AIDS is horrifyingly fast. / مُذْهِل (Causing astonishment.)  [astonishing]",
 "恐れ": "خَوْف, وَهَل (A strong, unpleasant emotion or feeling caused by actual or perceived danger or ) / خَافَ, خَشِيَ (To feel fear.) / خَافَ عَلَى, خَشِيَ عَلَى (To worry about, to feel concern for, to be afraid for [with for].) / خَافَ, خَشِيَ (To venerate; to feel awe towards.)  [fear]\nمثال: 環境汚染についての恐れは、人々に発電所の近くに家を建てることを思いとどまらせた。\n→ Fear of pollution discouraged people from building homes near power plants. / مُخَاطَرة (possible, usually negative, outcome) / مُجَازَفَة (possible, usually negative, outcome) / خَطَر (possible, usually negative, outcome) / خَاطَرَ (to incur risk to something) / خَاطَرَ (to incur risk of something)  [risk] / هَيْبَة (A feeling of fear and reverence.) / ذُهُول (A feeling of amazement.)  [awe]",
