 "恐れる": "خَوْف, وَهَل (A strong, unpleasant emotion or feeling caused by actual or perceived danger or ) / خَافَ, خَشِيَ (To feel fear.) / خَافَ عَلَى, خَشِيَ عَلَى (To worry about, to feel concern for, to be afraid for [with for].) / خَافَ, خَشِيَ (To venerate; to feel awe towards.)  [to fear]\nمثال: 大人はしばしば変化を恐れる。\n→ Older people often fear change.",
