 "恐ろしい": "فَظِيع (Dreadful; causing terror, alarm and fear; awesome) / مُرْعِب (Formidable, powerful.) / مُرْعِب (Intense; extreme in degree or extent.) / فَظِيع, أَرْبَد (Very unpleasant; disagreeable.) / فَظِيع, أَرْبَد (Very bad; lousy.)  [terrible]\nمثال: その嵐の天候は恐ろしかった。\n→ The stormy weather was dreadful. / دَهْشَة, تَعَجُّب (The feeling that something unexpected has happened.) / بَاغَتَ (cause (someone) to feel surprise) / فَاجَأَ (cause (someone) to feel surprise) / دَهِشَ (cause (someone) to feel surprise)  [surprising]\noften as 恐ろしく",
