 "悔む": "نَدَبَ (To express sadness or sorrow for; to grieve over (especially a death).)  [to mourn]\nمثال: あの方があんなに若くして亡くなったことは悔やまれます。\n→ It is regrettable that she should have died so young. / نَدِمَ (feel sorry about some past thing) / تَأَسَّفَ (feel sorry about some past thing) / أَسَف (instance of such an emotion) / تَأَسُّف (instance of such an emotion)  [to regret]\nمثال: よーし！覚えてろ。後で悔やむなよ。\n→ All right! You will be sorry for this.",
