 "悟る": "حَاسَّة (Any of the manners by which living beings perceive the physical world: for human) / إِحْسَاس, شُعُور (Perception through the intellect; apprehension; awareness.) / مَعْنَى, دَلَالَة (The meaning, reason, or value of something.) / مَوْهِبَة, قُدْرَة طَبِيعِيَّة (A natural appreciation or ability.) / حَسَّ (To use biological senses: to either see, hear, smell, taste, or feel.)  [to sense]\nمثال: 彼はついに自分の誤りを悟った。\n→ At last, he realized his error. / فَهِمَ (to grasp the meaning of)  [to understand]\nمثال: 彼はドイツ語で自分の言いたいことを伝えるのは難しいと悟った。\n→ He found it difficult to make himself understood in German. / [to attain enlightenment]",
