 "悠悠": "صَامِت, هَادِئ (With little or no sound; free of disturbing noise.)  [quiet]\nمثال: 飛行機は頭上をゆうゆうと飛んで行った。\n→ The airplane sailed over our heads. / بِسُهُولَة (Without difficulty.)  [easily] / بَعِيد  [distant]",
