 "悪だくみ": "حِيلَة (Something designed to fool, dupe, outsmart, mislead or swindle.)  [trick]\nمثال: 彼は絶対にその謀議に加担していなかった。反政府の悪だくみがあったのは、彼ではなくて、その兄だった。\n→ He has had absolutely no part in the conspiracy; it was not he, but his brother, who had an axe to grind against the government.",
