 "意識的": "اِئْتَمَرَ (To consider carefully; to weigh well in the mind.)  [deliberate]\nمثال: 彼が不作法なのは意識的であって、偶発的ではなかった。\n→ His rudeness was conscious, not accidental.",
 "意趣": "بُغْض, ضَغِينَة (Deep-seated and/or long-term animosity or ill will about something or someone, e)  [grudge] / قَصْد, إِرَادَة (A course of action that a person intends to follow.)  [intention] / عِنَاد (The state, or an act, of stubbornness or doggedness.)  [obstinacy] / عَقْل (Rational thinking (or the capacity for it); the cognitive faculties, collectivel)  [reason]",
 "意趣晴らし": "ثَأْر, اِنْتِقَام (Any form of personal, retaliatory action against an individual, institution, or ) / اِنْتَقَمَ (To take revenge for (a particular harmful action) or on behalf of (its victim); )  [revenge]",
