 "愚痴を零す": "تَذَمَّرَ, اِشْتَكَى (To express feelings of pain, dissatisfaction, or resentment.) / شَكَا, اِشْتَكَى (To make a formal accusation or bring a formal charge.)  [to complain]\nمثال: 僕はもう君がぐちをこぼすのを聞き飽きている。\n→ I'm getting sick of hearing you complain.",
