 "愚者": "مُغَفَّل, أَحْمَق (A person with poor judgment or little intelligence.)  [fool]\nمثال: 君子が恐れて踏み込まぬ所へも愚者は突入する。\n→ Fools rush in where angels fear to tread. / مُغَفَّل, أَحْمَق (A person with poor judgment or little intelligence.)  [The Fool (Tarot card)]",
