 "感化": "نَفُوذ, تَأْثِير (The power to affect, control or manipulate something or someone; the ability to ) / تَأْثِير (An action exerted by a person or thing with such power on another to cause chang) / أَثَّرَ (To have an effect on by using gentle or subtle action; to exert an influence upo)  [influence (on someone)]",
